---
description: Use variables only when value is reused; avoid single-letter names; prefer short descriptive names
alwaysApply: true
---

- Only use variables if the value is used in more than 1 place.
- Never use 1 letter variables. Always use short but descriptive names (e.g. prefer `userId` or `request` over `id` or `r` when the meaning isn’t obvious from context).
